  m_text: "Runtime: 129\u202Fminutes (2\u202Fhrs 9\u202Fmin) \n\nRelease Date: April
    10, 2025\n\nDescription: Ariff, a loyal elite bodyguard (\"Blood Brother\") for
    Dato\u202FZul\u2019s powerful Naga organisation, is falsely accused of betrayal.
    Framed and on the run, he seeks help from his estranged brother Jaki\u2014while
    his former best friend Ghaz is ordered to hunt him down. A gripping tale of trust,
    fraternity, deception, and redemption"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
