  m_text: "Runtime: Over 3 hours\n\nRelease Date: December\u202F19,\u202F2025 \n\nDescription:
    The third installment focuses on a civil war among the Na\u2019vi, highlighting
    a new \u201CAsh Clan\u201D led by Varang. The story shifts from human-Na\u2019vi
    conflict to internal Na\u2019vi divisions, and delves into themes of grief, vengeance,
    and cultural complexity on Pandora"
